/// - "indirect": syscall directo con SSN en EAX (RecycledGate via JMP indirecto al gadget)
/// - "veh": delega al sistema VEH que intercepta via hardware breakpoints
/// - "hgate": Heaven's Gate (WOW64 -> x64 transition)
