- `SEC_IMAGE`: `u32` = `0x0100_0000`
- `SECTION_ALL_ACCESS`: `u32` = `0x000F_001F`
- `PROCESS_ALL_ACCESS`: `u32` = `0x001F_FFFF`
- `THREAD_ALL_ACCESS`: `u32` = `0x001F_FFFF`
